{'symbol': 'AIZ', 'date': '2021-07-26 08:30:00', 'title': 'ASSURANT STUDY FINDS PANDEMIC-PROPELLED CONSUMER INTEREST IN CONNECTED PRODUCTS, SERVICES AND SUPPORT', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ASSURANT (NYSE: AIZ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FINDINGS FROM ITS LATEST CONNECTED DECADE SURVEY. NOW IN ITS FIFTH YEAR, ASSURANT'S ANNUAL STUDY EXAMINES CONSUMER ATTITUDES AROUND THE CONVERGENCE OF CONNECTED DEVICES AND THEIR IMPACT ON CONSUMERS, BUSINESS AND INDUSTRY. THE PANDEMIC, WHICH HAS IMPACTED INDIVIDUALS AND BUSINESSES IN DIFFERENT WAYS ACROSS THE WORLD, HAS LARGELY ACCELERATED CONSUMERS' EMBRACE OF ‘CONNECTED LIVING,' ENCOURAGING MANY TO SEEK MOBILE DEVICE UPGRADE"}